{"title":"扎实推进粤港澳大湾区建设","date":"2019-12-17","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\r\nmso-outline-level:3\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#1B1B1B;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">扎实推进粤港澳大湾区建设<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-color=\"rgb(254, 236, 175)\" data-style-id=\"25531\" data-support=\"96编辑器\">\r\n\t<section style=\"margin: 10px 0px; background-color: rgb(254, 236, 175); padding: 10px; color: rgb(172, 133, 2); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\";transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"background: #fefefe; box-shadow: rgba(225, 123, 119, 0.757) 0px 0px 15px 0px; overflow: hidden;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"border-bottom: 5px dashed rgb(254, 236, 175); border-top: 5px dashed rgb(254, 236, 175); margin-bottom: -1px; margin-top: -1px; border-left-color: rgb(254, 236, 175); border-right-color: rgb(254, 236, 175); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; padding: 1em; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.25pt;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:\r\n2.25pt;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:2.25pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;mso-para-margin-left:2.25pt;text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:150%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.25pt;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:\r\n2.25pt;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:2.25pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;mso-para-margin-left:2.25pt;text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:150%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#1B1B1B\">12</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#1B1B1B\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">16</span>日，广东省推进粤港澳大湾区建设领导小组第五次全体会议在广州召开，深入学习贯彻习近平总书记关于粤港澳大湾区建设重要指示精神和粤港澳大湾区建设领导小组第三次会议精神，研究我省贯彻落实意见和下一阶段重点工作。省委书记、省推进粤港澳大湾区建设领导小组组长李希主持会议，省长、省推进粤港澳大湾区建设领导小组常务副组长马兴瑞出席会议。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.25pt;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:\r\n2.25pt;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:2.25pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;mso-para-margin-left:2.25pt;text-indent:24.0pt;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#1B1B1B\">李希强调，要坚持以粤港澳大湾区建设为<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>纲<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>，以支持深圳建设中国特色社会主义先行示范区为牵引，全面激发大湾区、先行示范区利好叠加的<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>双区驱动效应<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>，推动广东高质量发展。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px 3px 15px; line-height: 150%; text-indent: 0em; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: #1b1b1b; font-size: 19px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201912/%E7%B2%A42.jpg\" style=\"width: 620px; height: 408px;\" /></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px 3px 15px; line-height: 150%; text-indent: 0em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.25pt;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:\r\n2.25pt;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:2.25pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;mso-para-margin-left:2.25pt;text-indent:24.0pt;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#1B1B1B\">一要深入学习贯彻习近平总书记关于粤港澳大湾区建设重要指示精神和党的十九届四中全会、中央经济工作会议、粤港澳大湾区领导小组第三次会议精神，坚定贯彻<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>一国两制<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>方针，<b>强化责任担当，扎实推进粤港澳大湾区建设，全力支持港澳融入国家发展大局。</b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.25pt;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:\r\n2.25pt;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:2.25pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;mso-para-margin-left:2.25pt;text-indent:24.0pt;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#1B1B1B\">二要<b>抓住重点、精细施工，加快广深港澳科技创新走廊建设，加强设施<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>硬联通<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>和机制<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>软联通<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span></b>，加快粤港澳重大合作平台建设，落实好中央惠港惠澳政策，推动大湾区建设行稳致远，年年有新进步。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.25pt;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:\r\n2.25pt;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:2.25pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;mso-para-margin-left:2.25pt;text-indent:24.0pt;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#1B1B1B\">三要加强组织领导，省市领导小组要发挥统筹协调作用，省直有关部门要切实做好各项政策宣传解读和落地落实，各市党政主要负责同志要切实担负起第一责任人职责，共同努力<b>推动大湾区建设各项任务落地落实</b>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm 2.25pt 6pt; line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#1B1B1B\">　　马兴瑞强调，要切实把思想和行动统一到以习近平同志为核心的党中央关于推进粤港澳大湾区建设的决策部署上来，进一步增强政治担当和使命担当，认真抓好这次会议工作部署落实。全省各有关单位要强化协同配合，形成工作合力，加快推进中央惠港惠澳政策及省有关政策举措实施，不断增强粤港澳大湾区的吸引力、凝聚力、向心力。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px 3px 15px; line-height: 150%; text-indent: 0em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#1B1B1B;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:ZH-CN;mso-bidi-language:\r\nAR-SA\">　　</span><span style=\"color: rgb(27, 27, 27); font-size: 14pt;\">会议还审议了有关文件。省领导张硕辅、林克庆、郑雁雄、许瑞生、陈良贤、张光军、覃伟中，省推进粤港澳大湾区建设领导小组其他成员、省有关单位负责同志参加会议。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.25pt;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:\r\n2.25pt;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:2.25pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;mso-para-margin-left:2.25pt;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#1B1B1B\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}